  "description": "This dashboard visualizes the six Prometheus counters emitted by utils/metrics.py. It assumes a Prometheus server is scraping the pipeline host. If no Prometheus server is available, use operator_dashboard.md for a Markdown-based fallback rendered from `python run.py metrics` output.",
